Deploy Kerbside with Kolla-Ansible.

This change implements the Kerbside Kolla-Ansible deployment role. While
Nova can now support protocol-native SPICE consoles, you need a proxy of
some form in between client traffic and the hypervisor to do this safely.
This patch implements a role for Kerbside, a SPICE proxy and application
level firewall.

Kerbside consists of two components which each have their own Kolla
container. kerbside-api handles business logic and is a uwsgi app.
kerbside-proxy is the SPICE native component. Because kerbside-proxy is
not talking HTTP to clients, and expects TLS encrypted traffic on the
secure port, it uses the frontend certificates to do TLS itself, and
haproxy simply acts as a layer four load balancer.

